1 0 0 1 58 736 Tm (Source-based overview) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 702 Tm (This guide presents Truth, Tact, Loyalty, Individuality, Courage, Accumulation,) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 687 Tm (Constructiveness and Sagacity as themes for independent study. The wording below is a) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 672 Tm (neutral explanation of the principles, not a claim that every modern phrase is a direct) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 657 Tm (quotation from Haanel.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 634 Tm (1. Truth) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 600 Tm (Truth begins with seeing what is actually present. Separate an observation from an) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 585 Tm (assumption and notice where a story has been added. Truth is the willingness to meet) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 570 Tm (facts, feelings and choices honestly before deciding what to do next.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 547 Tm (2. Tact) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 513 Tm (Tact is thoughtful judgement in relationship with other people. It includes sympathy,) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 498 Tm (understanding and the ability to consider likely consequences before acting. Tact is not) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 483 Tm (weakness or people-pleasing; it allows clear speech while remembering another person's) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 468 Tm (perspective and dignity.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 445 Tm (3. Loyalty) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 411 Tm (Loyalty is steadiness toward a chosen value, promise or relationship. It is tested by) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 396 Tm (ordinary repetition: keeping an agreement, returning to a practice and acting) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 381 Tm (consistently when enthusiasm changes. Loyalty should include discernment and boundaries.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 358 Tm (4. Individuality) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 324 Tm (Individuality means developing your own understanding and responsibility. Study can offer) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 309 Tm (a map, but it cannot make decisions for you. Notice which interpretations help you think) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 294 Tm (and act deliberately, then make room for your own experience.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 271 Tm (5. Courage) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 237 Tm (Courage is the capacity to take a considered step while uncertainty is still present. It) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 222 Tm (may mean asking an honest question, changing a familiar response or beginning an exercise) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 207 Tm (without knowing exactly what you will discover. A brave action can be small, informed and) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 192 Tm (reversible.) Tj
